  draw signature; new sketches, no archive source)
- entity.surface schema: sketch + resolution/fps/emissive/tint, clamped, valid on primitive
  meshes; threaded through resolver, serialization, and state() readout
- Drawn in the runtime's one per-frame pass (updateSimulation) -> CanvasTexture as material
  map + emissive map; inherits pause/step, never a second rAF
- Budget-gated: <=8 active surfaces/frame, <=1024 canvas, per-fps redraw throttle
- state().surfaceRedraws proves shared-loop drive; verified: spawn + round-trip + 0->60
  redraws over 120 steps at 30fps, three sketches render on meshes (screenshot)

